  "prefLabel": "Env-A 3208.02 Account Designation",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-A 3208.02 Account Designation. Unused allowances as of the end of the allowance transfer deadline shall be retained in the compliance, overdraft, or general account and designated as banked allowances after the administrator has made all deductions for a given control period from the compliance account or overdraft account pursuant to Env-A 3212.\n\nSource. #11001, eff 1-1-16; ss by #14632, eff 6-25-26, EXPIRES: 6-25-36",
